{#-
  Data model of the document.

  1. Extraction: the replies of the project as nested objects named by the json.key annotations of
     the knowledge model (dc|extract_replies, version 2). A question is an object with _value (the
     reply, or the json.value of the selected answer), a list question a list of item objects, a
     multi-choice question a list of choice objects. Chapters are the top level, e.g.
     x.creatingData. Every annotated question is present, also when it is not answered (_value
     none, [] for lists), so paths along the knowledge model never fail in the templates.
  2. Mapping: answers and choices without json.value get a code from FALLBACK_VALUES.

  The mapping (src/_mapping.j2) uses x and compares _value with the json.value of answers and
  choices.
-#}
{%- set dc = ctx|to_context_obj -%}

